"https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/戲劇/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">戲劇</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/八點檔/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">八點檔</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/基隆/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">基隆</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/世界盃/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">世界盃</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/朱立倫/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">朱立倫</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/中職/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">中職</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/台鐵/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">台鐵</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/屏東/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">屏東</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/科技/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">科技</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/法國/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">法國</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/總統/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">總統</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/新竹/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">新竹</a><a href="https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/tag/大谷翔平/" style="opacity:0;" class="word">大谷翔平</a><!--]--></div></div><div id="sticky_block-sticky-wrapper" class="my-5 items-center flex justify-center"></div></div></aside></div></main><!----><!--]--><footer class="bg-footer text-white"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="flex justify-center leading-6 p-4 flex-row flex-wrap"><span>民視財經網 © 2024 FTV All Rights Reserved.</span></div></div></footer><!--]--></div><div id="teleports"></div><script type="application/json" data-nuxt-data="nuxt-app" data-ssr="true" id="__NUXT_DATA__">[["ShallowReactive",1],{"data":2,"state":393,"once":402,"_errors":403,"serverRendered":406,"path":407},["ShallowReactive",3],{"detail-2026915W0374":4,"hotNews":83,"carouselImage":122,"hotNewsTagList":125,"hotVideo":266,"KeyRank":331},{"Status":5,"Desc":6,"ITEM":7,"ITEMB":27},"Success","",[8],{"ID":9,"CateTitle":10,"Title":11,"ShortTitle":11,"SubTitle":6,"4gtvLink":6,"Preface":12,"Content":13,"Mid":14,"Image":15,"Thumb":16,"ImgNote":17,"VPlatform":18,"Video":6,"FtvNewsCDNID":6,"KeyWord":19,"Ord":20,"CreateDate":21,"UpdateDate":21,"Author":22,"WebLink":23,"appId":24,"ModuleName":25,"Restrict":26,"Aphorism":6,"AIReadTXT":6},"2026915W0374","政治","開放澎湖全球免簽.世界的澎湖！媒體工作者廖璟華投入議員選戰","\u003Cp>南部中心／澎湖綜合報導\u003Cbr>媒體人出身的廖璟華，投入議員選戰，她特別選擇從湖西鄉成功村澎湖湖西鄉成功村天軍殿，是一座主祀武財神趙公明的百年歷史信仰中心出發，為這次參選縣議員活動拉開序幕。廖璟華倡議，爭取開放澎湖全球免簽&quot;世界的澎湖&quot;，讓中央法令鬆綁，以促進澎湖經濟大發展。\u003C/p>","\u003Cfigure class=\"fr-img-caption fr-fic fr-dib fr-draggable\" draggable=\"false\">\u003Cfigure class=\"fr-img-wrap\">\u003Cimg alt='開放澎湖全球免簽.世界的澎湖！媒體工作者廖璟華投入議員選戰' src=\"https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/summernotefiles/News/8717916a-a844-4d1e-a148-ec7a9d9a3a65.jpg\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"fr-inner\">開著手排檔的電子看版行動車，廖璟華力拼澎湖縣議員。（圖／民視新聞）\u003C/figcaption>\u003C/figure>\u003C/figure>媒體工作者廖璟華認為，多元化的社會才是進步的動力。大多數的候選人都在文宣海報掛牆上，廖璟華卻自己開著手排檔的貝傳媒電子看版行動車，追著湖西鄉的垃圾車沿著街道深入村里趴趴走。廖璟華選戰開跑，特別選擇從湖西鄉成功村澎湖湖西鄉成功村天軍殿、又稱港底天軍殿，是一座主祀武財神趙公明趙府元帥的百年歷史信仰中心出發，為這次參選縣議員活動拉開序幕。媒體人出身的廖璟華倡議，爭取開放澎湖全球免簽《世界的澎湖》，讓中央法令鬆綁，以促進澎湖經濟大發展。與澎湖縣長陳光復關係互動深厚的馬公長老教會廖述哲牧師，也特別為七美鄉姐妹鄭淑卿與湖西鄉姐妹廖璟華祈禱。\u003Cfigure>\u003Cfigure class=\"fr-img-caption fr-fic fr-dib fr-draggable\" draggable=\"false\">\u003Cfigure class=\"fr-img-wrap\">\u003Cimg alt='開放澎湖全球免簽.世界的澎湖！媒體工作者廖璟華投入議員選戰' src=\"https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/summernotefiles/News/c7791c56-25f8-44a1-89d7-3e04f3c1f0bc.jpg\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"fr-inner\">廖璟華提出，龍門村可發展為科技園區，發展無人載具場域。（圖／民視新聞）\u003C/figcaption>\u003C/figure>\u003C/figure>\u003C/figure>廖牧師指引，真正的智慧不是凡事都有答案，而是每一次選擇裡敬畏神知道什麼該靠近什麼該遠離，願我們不只相信自己的判斷，更願讓神帶領腳步。對於近來攸關國安的無人機產業，湖西鄉縣議員候選人廖璟華倡議：讓澎湖成為台灣無人機產業「從可用到可靠最關鍵的最後一哩路」。提出龍門村發展為科技園區，發展無人載具場域。廖璟華表示，據消息指出：工研院在今年6月正式成為美國境外首家取得Green UAS（綠色無人機）認證資格機構後，進一步與美方合作開發全台首套自製「非紅供應鏈檢測平台」，將評測標準工具化、數位化。工研院表示，目前已有逾20家國內無人機及關鍵零組件業者提出評測需求，搶搭非紅供應鏈出海商機。廖璟華表示，今年4月29日澎湖科技大學主辦無人載具技術與應用論壇結論：澎湖具備台灣最接近實際環境條件強風，高鹽，海域遼闊，島嶼分散，是無人機最珍貴的測試場地。而根據據業者透露，澎湖縣湖西鄉龍門村是他們公認絕佳場地。","POL","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/53f60468-5671-4f2c-91a3-82670b047664.jpg","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/1/53f60468-5671-4f2c-91a3-82670b047664.jpg","媒體人出身的廖璟華，投入議員選戰。（圖／民視新聞）","Y","廖璟華,議員,澎湖,九合一選舉,湖西鄉",1,"2026/09/15 14:04:06","陳姵妡（記者－南部）","https://www.ftvnews.com.tw/news/detail/2026915W0374","264991820642095","news","否",[28,37,44,50,58,64,70,77],{"ID":29,"Title":30,"Mid":14,"Image":31,"Thumb":32,"VPlatform":33,"Video":34,"FtvNewsCDNID":35,"CreateDate":36},"2026915W0288","快新聞／蔣萬安人氣退燒？都更記者會僅1藍小雞捧場　沈伯洋一劍封喉","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/d8ff4fb6-582b-4549-aed2-f8eb60a23a1a.jpg","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/1/d8ff4fb6-582b-4549-aed2-f8eb60a23a1a.jpg","DP","kKa9hssVKhFxvLJTAQC","8985bbbb-4d13-42f9-839d-ded35bd6bedf","2026/09/15 12:26:10",{"ID":38,"Title":39,"Mid":14,"Image":40,"Thumb":41,"VPlatform":18,"Video":42,"FtvNewsCDNID":6,"CreateDate":43},"2026915W0309","快新聞／台北選情起風了！秦慧珠曝蔣萬安好感度下降　本人急回應了","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/08bd0c9e-b9fb-45da-bad1-4c4268a06143.jpg","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/1/08bd0c9e-b9fb-45da-bad1-4c4268a06143.jpg","yGx-6fMFDx0","2026/09/15 12:45:05",{"ID":45,"Title":46,"Mid":14,"Image":47,"Thumb":48,"VPlatform":18,"Video":6,"FtvNewsCDNID":6,"CreateDate":49},"2026915W0312","快新聞／蔣市府自我矮化？小巨蛋天幕驚見「中華台北」　綠黨團重砲怒轟","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/5316c926-7c1e-4277-8c7f-526687400275.jpg","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/1/5316c926-7c1e-4277-8c7f-526687400275.jpg","2026/09/15 13:01:03",{"ID":51,"Title":52,"Mid":14,"Image":53,"Thumb":54,"VPlatform":33,"Video":55,"FtvNewsCDNID":56,"CreateDate":57},"2026915W0325","快新聞／台北營養午餐只發3顆藍莓！局長竟瞎回這句　沈伯洋酸爆：很好笑","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/8add5a80-de05-434e-b38c-2f833f12f3d6.jpg","https://cdn.ftvnews.com.tw/manasystem/FileData/News/1/8add5a80-de05-434e-b38c-2f833f12f3d6.jpg","k15hIjAwD8F8ahJTI54","b3ae61ea-3c77-4f8c-a2c0-7979e21a51dd","2026/09/15 13:16:46",{"ID":59,"Title":60,"Mid":14,"Image":61,"Thumb":62,"VPlatform":18,"Video":6,"FtvN